{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And you shall guard your souls greatly, for you saw no form.</b> He says: since you know with clarity that you saw no form whatsoever, from now on you must take care not to make any form, any pesel — that is, anything carved/sculpted — nor the form of any symbol. For there are among the nations those who worship and bow down to whatever animal or beast they first encounter at the start of the day, and the scholars of investigation have written in their books that the constellation of Scorpio casts its power upon it to bite and to harm."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:45:17.827824934Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}